        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Alliance Gator is a family, not a single sand. Maxx G2 is the flexible flagship, rated from 1/8 inch to 4 inches, approved over slabs and rain-safe 15 minutes after watering; Supersand Bond G2 covers the joints most patios actually have; Gator Dust Bond is the flagstone specialist. Choose by joint width and base first, and by brand second.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Read the claims for what they are. Haze-free is the maker's promise, dry pavers are still the requirement, and the 15-year warranty refunds the bags rather than the work. Measure the joints, install on a dry day, compact properly and water exactly as the bag says, and Gator will do what it is rated to do.
          </p>
